    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cc9ab3fd23114e5e124210",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家为穿一样的运动鞋感到兴奋不已。\n但是，特别挑选一样款式的意义，\n对我来说完全无法理解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06bf1ac872e00a0998a3c8fadd725b7ef77489f45defedd82db7a1398c4ce7ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
