    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d339644c3954e183e2bd273",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从秋川理事长那里\n得知㭴本代理过去的＜First＞队，\n所有人都是一脸茫然的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f23374e3f3d1b42abcad3319d60a4e71e280ef083adfc453d98cf37b70cfad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
