      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997ac5165f2b8992f7179318",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "队伍的综合实力会影响队伍排行榜，\n所以必须和别人“打好关系”什么的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96f0904bb048a9fcc74ec58dc629022422de111524fd723fe4e118d5ca205b19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e0b238f8caf049ba06e62e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小小蚕茧",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f36ab4bbc7094be655ad178a01f38c0e7a1597fc0595ebaa3a7fa36071de850",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ee97d62f61e40344246856",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当我对这些感到不满时……\n突然被㭴本训练员叫了过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bdfdcec64887f73b9b80d99d280c5727a709616be95852db776b9e8d4ba39fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d8109fcf3977aa5b249837d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "㭴本理子",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e73181a7e51e7b12f2ed531c20b941b82a94f94c330157fee939a2c2298bb0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d3345e8345d2f335d49dc52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的队伍会由我管理。\n你们没必要互相影响彼此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c775160df5e3ef6b119e2071492810459cc00dd1d1cc76d3b442598d73aa99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a727508e7c2d0ef1a0493e37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "㭴本理子",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e73181a7e51e7b12f2ed531c20b941b82a94f94c330157fee939a2c2298bb0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9947acd50b9e32a4e3bd83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成员各自做好自己的工作，不对别人\n进行多余的干涉，这才叫专业的队伍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0a22c2b6c840843f6fe237803bd5345153cec0d78c6661107f974f999769f52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002026.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
